<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces killed two of their own personnel during a raid on an ISIL cell near Damascus and the Lebanese border. Israeli forces carried out a raid in southern Syria that killed a Syrian man with Down syndrome in Daraa. Syrian internal security forces launched an operation against an ISIS cell in Rankous, resulting in two security personnel deaths, and reported clashes with suspected ISIS fighters elsewhere in the Damascus countryside. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPREFDTmNYTXJhX2tQdV93OXZRbmoyRnJGVkF0VEtzRXlkNUNDYk15cGpFNHd0YXBqUXA2VGhfdkdKSXRRdHVXb0dUaXR6R3hUY05qWjJhbFUyMzBMYU43dU9GUkhmYl9YbmM3YjRzQmJGTzJPMWo0VXJHV2R6cG1xMXNmSjluM2ViX2lxWGtxYUtRWm9oa19BT2R0WHMzMlMtNU0zUVcxTjZidGFDbWg3d1pQdWI1clRwMFYzVTQyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTEFVX3lxTE9UbXk5eENIOGRTU0g5dmxBN2xRMDVfUGVlRkgzX0pmR0tINUppTVFkWEpJSHZCcXd2eTBqU2pmX1VscHlQdmtGTUk1OGM?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;صوت الإمارات&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE5penZ6Zk11eG53d3hGQ2hiLTNmZENiaHZhbjZjb3h0T1hYVGVTRzNqc2lSRWZ3RVl0VFE3dUd5bGtjNUstUDRvVW95TdIBS0FVX3lxTE5penZ6Zk11eG53d3hGQ2hiLTNmZENiaHZhbjZjb3h0T1hYVGVTRzNqc2lSRWZ3RVl0VFE3dUd5bGtjNUstUDRvVW95TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;نون بوست&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot